      "url": "https://x.com/VortixWx/status/1979228191144173719",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/VortixWx/status/1979228191144173719",
      "text": "#WxHistory |\n[🧵] We'll talk about two major typhoons that hit Luzon Philippines on this day. \n\nFirst, Typhoon Dot '85 (Saling) peaked as a C5 Super Typhoon. Its peak was 175mph (150kts) & a pressure of 897mb. Dot hammered the Philippines with potent force. Nueva Ecija Province had most of its buildings sustain damage from flooding & destructive winds. \n\nDot hit Sanya, China where communications were lost. \n\nOverall, Dot killed 90 people. \n[1/2]",
